        "text_WY8YBV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Looking for fresh and fun <em>kids birthday party ideas in Detroit</em>? Celebrate your child with a one-of-a-kind experience at Rebel Nell! Each party is designed to spotlight your child’s personality and creativity. Kids create their own meaningful talisman and leave with a keepsake that celebrates what makes them unique. We provide the space, materials, and guidance — you bring the birthday energy! A party like no other, filled with self-expression and unforgettable memories.<br/><br/></p><p></p>"
